{"page":20112,"part":1,"text":"古碑毁坏\n\n\n古碑毁坏\n\n赵德甫谓所著《金石录》寿于二千卷所载之碑，由今观之，信然。石刻固易朽之物，其如随时废兴，摧毁非一。前辈所载，元祐中，丞相韩玉汝帅长安，修石桥，督责甚峻，村民急以应期，悉皆磨石刻以代之，前人之碑尽矣。余又闻萧千岩云：“蔡拱之访求石碑，或蹊田害稼，村民深以为苦，悉鑱凿其文字，或为柱础帛碪，略不容存留。” 又自乱离而来，所在城堡攻战之处，军兵率取碑凿为炮石，摧毁无余。凡此皆是时所遭，其仆坏之门，殆非一端，盖亦碑刻之一厄会也。","eligible":true,"blockedReasons":[],"source":{"kind":"human-txt","page":20112,"part":1,"label":"wolai标准正文／原人工审核独有补充","verifiedBy":"项目负责人（本对话确认）","verifiedAt":"2026-10-22T07:57:06+00:00","revision":"0cabe5672ba41cb51b92d8abf4f7646c09debc7d76a09390e94ded7c7811d6b2","textSha256":"0cabe5672ba41cb51b92d8abf4f7646c09debc7d76a09390e94ded7c7811d6b2","fileSha256":"0cabe5672ba41cb51b92d8abf4f7646c09debc7d76a09390e94ded7c7811d6b2","txtPath":"annotation-data/wolai-txt/20112-work-117.txt","reviewCsvPath":"annotation-data/wolai-review.csv","standardCorpus":"wolai-standard","displayLabel":"负暄野录 · 古碑毁坏","sourceUrl":"https://www.wolai.com/mojiyi/jUfro2aGUdYe1C5AQUsp44","originalPages":[387,390],"positionStatus":"原图只作篇目参考；新版正文不声称与旧扫描逐字对齐","provenance":[{"start":0,"end":5,"sourceTextSha256":"0e948dd67da26ee737fad98074f9cbf2f67f35a960c3cfaaaea9ed9ce2090963","id":"local-387-185-196","page_id":387,"origin":"legacy-reviewed-txt","rawStart":185,"rawEnd":196,"reviewedTextSha256":"aa1bbed45e876780aacae18fba380dedd6cfed8634f71c99c2466f86a69743b9","displayUnitOrigins":[[191,192],[192,193],[193,194],[194,195],[195,196]],"legacySource":{"kind":"human-txt","page":387,"part":2,"label":"人工审核原TXT","verifiedBy":"郑雨荻","verifiedAt":"2026-10-19T13:13:23.635Z","revision":"aa1bbed45e876780aacae18fba380dedd6cfed8634f71c99c2466f86a69743b9","textSha256":"aa1bbed45e876780aacae18fba380dedd6cfed8634f71c99c2466f86a69743b9","fileSha256":"a7959b8ad3ac4b1328d4afcc5960761834bc9dbc83e2ea2d0c51808b9658a61c","txtPath":"tasks/2026-10-21-review-package-update/extracted/member-2-part-2/第2份-逐页校勘.txt","reviewCsvPath":"tasks/2026-10-21-review-package-update/extracted/member-2-part-2/第2份-TXT校验表.csv","reviewJsonPath":"tasks/2026-10-21-review-package-update/extracted/mem